                <mxCell id="s1-body" value="Capture data shape · build threshold → (projected pairs, cost) curves&#xa;&#xa;• co-hit / co-citation projection = EXACT (sparse Hᵀ·H over hit/pub sets)&#xa;• co-essentiality volume = ESTIMATED from random sample of selective genes + confidence band&#xa;• record sample size + seed (reproducibility)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eafaf1;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
