                <mxCell id="s5-body" value="• BH-FDR per channel across WHOLE pair space (record space size)&#xa;• per-channel + overall tier (Strong / Moderate / Weak) via empirical tier_cuts&#xa;• DROP pairs below support floor → logged in etl_audit_log&#xa;• supersede prior config build (is_current = FALSE)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
